Synchronize CivetWeb stop flag access during Exposer teardown.

The pinned default uses volatile loads/stores between mg_stop and its
master/worker threads. TSan reports a race in native_metrics teardown.
Use compiler atomics on the supported Clang/GCC toolchains and route the
alternative queue's reads through the same accessors. This preserves the
0 (running), 1 (stopping), 2 (stopped) protocol and existing thread joins.

